@startuml States - Game Session
' Decision: ADR-0002 makes these transitions server-authoritative.
title State Machine: Game Session
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #E8F5E9
  StartColor #4CAF50
  EndColor #4CAF50
}

[*] --> CREATED : authenticated player\ncreates solo session

CREATED --> PLAYING : server accepts start

CREATED --> ABORTED : cancelled or expired

PLAYING --> FINISHED : last round completed
PLAYING --> ABORTED : unrecoverable session failure

FINISHED --> [*] : immutable history snapshot\npersisted once
ABORTED --> [*]

note right of CREATED
  Configuration and selected tracks
  are immutable snapshots.
end note

note right of PLAYING
  Server state, time, deadlines,
  answers, and score are canonical.
  [[../adr/0002-server-authoritative-sessions.md ADR-0002]]
end note

note right of FINISHED
  History persists in PostgreSQL.
  [[../adr/0006-postgresql-history-snapshots.md ADR-0006]]
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Round
' Decision: ADR-0002 makes these transitions server-authoritative.
title State Machine: Round (current track)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
}

[*] --> PREPARING : server prepares round\nand playback grant

PREPARING --> PLAYING : authoritative startAt reached

PLAYING --> REVEALED : correct title, skip,\nor server deadline

REVEALED --> COMPLETED : approved progression rule
COMPLETED --> [*] : next round or game finish

note right of PREPARING
  Client may preload a short-lived
  pre-signed audio URL.
  [[../adr/0005-private-s3-media-and-presigned-playback.md ADR-0005]]
end note

note right of PLAYING
  Client countdown is presentational.
  Server evaluates every command.
  [[../adr/0002-server-authoritative-sessions.md ADR-0002]]
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Music Import
title State Machine: Music Import (yt-dlp)
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
}

[*] --> QUEUED : POST /admin/tracks/import\n(admin submits URL)

QUEUED --> DOWNLOADING : yt-dlp starts

DOWNLOADING --> PROCESSING : audio downloaded\nFFmpeg converts to MP3

DOWNLOADING --> FAILED : network error\nor invalid link

PROCESSING --> DONE : audio file ready\npreview available

PROCESSING --> FAILED : FFmpeg error\nor unsupported format

DONE --> PUBLISHED : admin validates\n(POST /validate)

DONE --> REJECTED : admin rejects\n(POST /reject)

FAILED --> [*] : job archived\nwith errorMessage

PUBLISHED --> [*] : track available\nin the catalogue

REJECTED --> [*] : audio file\ndeleted from server

note right of DOWNLOADING
  Progress 0-50%
  notified via WebSocket
  /user/queue/import/{jobId}
end note

note right of PROCESSING
  Progress 50-100%
  notified via WebSocket
end note

note right of DONE
  Admin listens to preview
  in the game interface
  before validating.
end note

@enduml

@startuml States - Friend Request
title State Machine: Friend Request
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam state {
  BorderColor #888888
  BackgroundColor #FCE4EC
}

[*] --> PENDING : Player A sends\na request\n(POST /users/{id}/friend-request)

PENDING --> ACCEPTED : Player B accepts\n(POST /requests/{id}/accept)

PENDING --> DECLINED : Player B declines\n(POST /requests/{id}/decline)

PENDING --> [*] : Player A cancels\n(DELETE /requests/{id})

ACCEPTED --> [*] : Either player\nremoves friend\n(DELETE /friends/{id})

DECLINED --> [*] : Request archived

note right of PENDING
  WebSocket notification
  sent to Player B:
  FRIEND_REQUEST { fromUser }
end note

note right of ACCEPTED
  WebSocket notification
  sent to Player A:
  FRIEND_REQUEST_ACCEPTED
end note

@enduml
